{
  "_meta": {
    "spdx-license": "EUPL-1.2",
    "spdx-copyright": "2026 Conduction B.V.",
    "change": "bookkeeping-payroll-engine-nl",
    "adr": "ADR-037 modular register fragment — never edit shillinq_register.json",
    "description": "Full NL Loonadministratie engine. Adds seven payroll schemas to the shillinq register via the ADR-037 fragment loader (SettingsService:deepMergeConfig unions components.schemas / components.objects by key/list): Werkgever (employer fiscal setup), Werknemer (employee fiscal master. References the existing NC/OR Person; BSN is a special-category identifier, masked in API output and never logged raw), LoonPeriode (week/4-week/month payroll batch per employer), LoonStrook (full bruto->netto payslip with all line items, cumulatieven snapshot, vakantiegeld reservation), LoonheffingTabel2026 (immutable, versioned 2026 wage-tax table), LHAfdracht (per-period Belastingdienst remittance aggregate, VOORBEREID for the SBR app), and Loonjournaalpost (auto-balanced GL posting, debit==credit). The bruto->netto arithmetic, SV/ZVW premium caps, vakantietoeslag opbouw, pro-rata mutaties, DGA gebruikelijk-loon check and belastingvrije toelagen live in OCA\\Shillinq\\Service\\PayrollCalculator (pure logic, no OR dependency); OCA\\Shillinq\\Service\\PayrollService wires that helper to live OR data via the real ObjectService API (find / findAll / saveObject). Seed objects ship a worked Conduction B.V. May-2026 example (employer, fulltime + parttime + DGA employees, a closed period, payslips, the LH-afdracht and the balanced journaalpost) per design.md."
  },
